WEBVTT

NOTE FailSafe: From Change to Confidence (v6.0.12). Narration: synthetic voice, generated locally in Sonic Rift.

1
00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:03.254
AI can help you write code faster.

2
00:00:04.031 --> 00:00:07.032
But when something changes,
how do you know what happened,

3
00:00:07.072 --> 00:00:09.892
what it affects, and
whether it's ready to ship?

4
00:00:11.200 --> 00:00:12.672
Meet FailSafe.

5
00:00:13.444 --> 00:00:17.730
A development companion that helps solo
developers keep their work visible,

6
00:00:17.770 --> 00:00:22.288
understand potential risks, and maintain
a record of important decisions.

7
00:00:23.200 --> 00:00:25.253
Setup starts in the Console.

8
00:00:26.083 --> 00:00:27.903
Install the Qor-Logic skills,

9
00:00:27.943 --> 00:00:32.041
approve the request in VS Code,
and the workspace is ready.

10
00:00:33.700 --> 00:00:37.152
With version 6.0.12, the Console, Monitor,

11
00:00:37.192 --> 00:00:41.765
and SRE views share a
consistent visual experience.

12
00:00:42.505 --> 00:00:45.265
Change your theme, and
your workspace follows.

13
00:00:46.161 --> 00:00:49.335
The information stays familiar,
wherever you're working.

14
00:00:51.100 --> 00:00:53.758
Now imagine a small but important bug.

15
00:00:54.493 --> 00:00:57.650
A date validator accepts
a day that doesn't exist.

16
00:00:58.325 --> 00:01:03.723
We document the issue, write a regression
test, and see the failure for ourselves.

17
00:01:05.100 --> 00:01:07.384
Fixing the code is only part of the job.

18
00:01:08.151 --> 00:01:12.389
FailSafe helps surface the risks and
governance requirements around a change,

19
00:01:12.429 --> 00:01:15.513
so the developer knows what
still needs attention.

20
00:01:16.500 --> 00:01:19.397
The corrected validator passes its tests.

21
00:01:20.162 --> 00:01:23.455
We can inspect the difference,
see the recorded decisions,

22
00:01:23.495 --> 00:01:26.963
and compare the result with
what we intended to change.

23
00:01:27.700 --> 00:01:29.523
Every change has a story.

24
00:01:30.259 --> 00:01:35.854
What we set out to do, what we changed, what
we checked, and what still needs review.

25
00:01:36.588 --> 00:01:39.771
FailSafe helps make that
story easier to follow.

26
00:01:40.400 --> 00:01:43.149
Move faster without
losing sight of the work.

27
00:01:43.906 --> 00:01:44.743
FailSafe.

28
00:01:45.515 --> 00:01:46.901
Build with AI.

29
00:01:47.606 --> 00:01:48.749
Know what changed.
